{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "corridor",
  "conversations": {
    "corridor_speaker": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cs_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cs_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "喇叭在响。凑近一点，才知道不是电流声。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cs_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "里头有人开了口。还没听清，就又有几个人叠了上来。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cs_q_q"
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_q_q",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你在这儿也听得见？我坐那底下背过词。老以为轮到我念。",
          "next": "cs_3",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": [
              "q_companion"
            ]
          },
          "source": "reported"
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "声音一断，你才发觉自己等的是一个姓。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "corridor_trolley": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ct_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ct_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "车停得很正。一只轮子倒斜着，像是刚才有人想把它推出去。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "ct_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "车从这儿挪开，柜门也只够开一半。可总有人把它停在这儿。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "ct_q_q"
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_q_q",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "别替值日的收。上次我收了一回，他们就说以后归我了。",
          "next": "ct_3",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": [
              "q_companion"
            ]
          },
          "source": "reported"
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "柜子里的本子露着一排白边。哪本是谁的，得抽出来才知道。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "corridor_wait": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cw_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cw_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "栏杆在这里接了一截。手放上去，接缝那头稍微高一点。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cw_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "从这儿能同时看见两个篮圈。近的遮住一小块线，远的什么也没遮住。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cw_3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一直没人来捡球。你又往场地边上看了眼，才记起刚才并没有球。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null,
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": ["corridor_waited"]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "corridor_waited",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "corridor_waited",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "课间在栏杆边站了一会儿；从那里看得见院里的两个篮圈。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "corridor_directory_tab": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cd_choose",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cd_choose",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "两头都能卡住。回来时，你想先认哪一样？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "glass",
              "text": "往玻璃门那边拨。",
              "next": "cd_glass",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "type": "set_flag",
                  "flag": "corridor_directory_tab",
                  "value": "glass"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "stair",
              "text": "往楼梯那边拨。",
              "next": "cd_stair",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "type": "set_flag",
                  "flag": "corridor_directory_tab",
                  "value": "stair"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "把手收回来。",
              "next": "cd_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd_glass",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "先认玻璃门吧。从街上也看得见。至于进门是第几层，进去再数。",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "directory_mark_glass",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "在两处 01 下面，我把路签拨向玻璃门。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd_stair",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "门谁都找得到。要再找刚才那间，还是得认上去的第一截楼梯。",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "directory_mark_stair",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "在两处 01 下面，我把路签拨向楼梯。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd_leave",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "指头在签上焐出一点热。就这样吧。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
